>NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13007_111882_456554"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A color that is mixed with black. A 10-percent shade is one part of the original color and nine parts black.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="111882">shade</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ps-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="456554">سيورى</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13016_346958_457708"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of partial control parents get over the accounts and devices of their children helping them supervise how their children behave online and letting them restrict what their children see.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="346958">parental controls</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ps-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="457708">پلرین مهارونه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13047_48461_456168"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The naming convention for disk drives or partitions on most computers, consisting of an alphabetical letter followed by a colon.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="48461">drive letter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singula