p type="definition">The standard single-byte character encoding scheme used for text-based data. ASCII uses designated 7-bit or 8-bit number combinations to represent either 128 or 256 possible characters.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="14931">American Standard Code for Information Interchange</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ps-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="455895">د خبرتیاوو د تبادلې لپاره د امریکا کره کوډ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15266_188012_456957"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A reusable component that wraps Web-based content (such as XML, HTML, and scripting) with a standard property schema and displays that in a cohesive unit on a page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="188012">Web Part</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ps-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="456957">ګورت برخه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15266_2487036_456957"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A reusable component that wraps Web-based content (such as XML, HTML, and scripting) with a standard property schema and displays that in a cohesive unit on a page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2487036">web part</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammat